\f0\fs24 \cf0 # \uc0\u55357 \u57072 \u65039  Antigravity: Zero-G Inventory Engine\
\
Antigravity is a **cloud-native, AI-powered inventory management system** designed to help businesses predict, optimize, and control their stock flow with precision.\
\
Antigravity; i\uc0\u351 letmelerin stoklar\u305 n\u305  **\'f6nceden tahmin eden, optimize eden ve kontrol alt\u305 na alan** bulut tabanl\u305  yapay zeka destekli bir envanter y\'f6netim sistemidir.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u56960  Features\
\
- **\uc0\u9729 \u65039  Cloud-Native Infrastructure**  \
  All data is securely stored in the cloud. No local dependency, no data loss risk.\
\
- **\uc0\u55358 \u56598  AI-Powered Forecasting**  \
  Predicts stock shortages before they happen using sales data and lead time analysis.\
\
- **\uc0\u55357 \u56522  Smart Decision Engine**  \
  Tells you *when* and *how much* to restock based on real-time insights.\
\
- **\uc0\u55357 \u56580  Flexible Use Cases**  \
  Easily adaptable for:\
  - Industrial products  \
  - Furniture stores  \
  - Real estate tracking  \
  - Hardware shops  \
\
- **\uc0\u55356 \u57100  Modern UI (Cyberpunk Style)**  \
  Dark-mode focused interface for better concentration and usability.\
\
---\
\
## \uc0\u55357 \u57056 \u65039  Tech Stack\
\
- **Backend:** Python (Flask)  \
- **Database:** MongoDB Atlas  \
- **AI Engine:** Custom-built analysis system  \
- **Environment:** dotenv  \
\
